<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Amanda Tasya Salsabilla — Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; color: #4E1021; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(31,7,14,0.22), rgba(31,7,14,0.3)), url('data:image/jpeg;base64,');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-attachment: fixed;
    }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; }
    .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .glass {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,250,251,0.88), rgba(252,243,245,0.82));
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.16);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(24,5,10,0.28);
    }
    header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 40;
      background: rgba(250,242,244,0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.14);
      padding: 16px 24px;
    }
    .nav-wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
    .brand { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: #4E1021; text-decoration: none; }
    nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }
    nav a { color: #6B1D33; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; }
    nav a:hover { color: #3D0A18; }
    .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: center; padding: 40px; }
    .kicker { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: #8C4558; }
    .hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.05; color: #4E1021; margin-top: 10px; }
    .rule { width: 64px; height: 2px; background: rgba(107,29,51,0.35); margin: 20px 0; }
    .lead { font-size: 0.98rem; color: #6E273B; max-width: 500px; }
    .portrait-box { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; max-height: 460px; margin-left: auto; width: 100%; max-width: 390px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.2); }
    .portrait-box img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 20%; display: block; }
    .card-pad { padding: 36px; }
    .pill-title { display: inline-block; background: #7E4956; color: #FFF8F9; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .bio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 22px 40px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .bio-label { font-size: 0.76rem; color: #8C4558; font-weight: 500; }
    .bio-value { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: #4E1021; margin-top: 2px; }
    .tasks-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .task-card { padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; }
    .task-title { font-size: 1.35rem; color: #5E0B1E; margin-top: 8px; }
    .task-desc { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #6E1B2E; margin-top: 8px; }
    .hobbies-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .hobby-card { overflow: hidden; }
    .hobby-card img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .hobby-body { padding: 22px; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 28px 24px; background: rgba(250,242,244,0.88); border-top: 1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.15); font-size: 0.82rem; color: #6E273B; }
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid, .bio-grid, .tasks-grid, .hobbies-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .portrait-box { margin: 0 auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav-wrap">
      <a href="#beranda" class="brand">Amanda Tasya</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#beranda">Beranda</a>
        <a href="#biodata">Biodata</a>
        <a href="#tugas">Tugas Kuliah</a>
        <a href="#hobi">Minat &amp; Hobi</a>
        <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section id="beranda" class="glass hero-grid reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Universitas Lambung Mangkurat · Sosial Ekonomi Perikanan</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Biodata Lengkap Mahasiswa</h1>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <p class="lead">Profil akademik dan data pribadi saya sebagai mahasiswa aktif di lingkungan Fakultas Perikanan dan Ilmu Kelautan, Universitas Lambung Mangkurat.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portrait-box">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Foto profil Amanda Tasya Salsabilla" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="biodata" class="glass card-pad reveal">
      <div class="pill-title">Data Pribadi</div>
      <div class="bio-grid">
        
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Nama Lengkap</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Amanda Tasya Salsabilla</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">NIM</div>
            <div class="bio-value mono">2410715320005</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Universitas</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Universitas Lambung Mangkurat</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Fakultas</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Fakultas Perikanan dan Ilmu Kelautan</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Program Studi</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Sosial Ekonomi Perikanan</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Tempat, Tanggal Lahir</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Kuala Kapuas, 6 September 2006</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Alamat</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Jalan Listrik II</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Hobi</div>
            <div class="bio-value ">Menari dan Badminton</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="bio-label">Email</div>
            <div class="bio-value mono">illacasya@gmail.com</div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tugas" class="reveal">
      <div class="glass card-pad">
        <p class="kicker">02. Dokumentasi Perkuliahan</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:2rem; color:#5E0B1E; margin-top:6px;">Arsip Modul &amp; Tugas Kuliah</h2>
        <div class="tasks-grid">
          
            <div class="glass task-card">
              <div>
                <div class="kicker mono">01 · Google Form &amp; Sheet</div>
                <h3 class="task-title">Tugas 1 — Pengisian Google Form</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Pelaksanaan pengisian dan perancangan kuesioner digital melalui Google Form untuk menghimpun data lapangan terkait karakteristik responden dan aktivitas sosial ekonomi perikanan.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kicker" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.12); padding-top:12px;">Google Forms</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass task-card">
              <div>
                <div class="kicker mono">02 · Looker Studio</div>
                <h3 class="task-title">Tugas 2 — Dashboard Looker Studio</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Pembuatan dashboard visual interaktif menggunakan Looker Studio untuk menyajikan ringkasan metrik, grafik distribusi, serta perbandingan data responden secara komunikatif.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kicker" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.12); padding-top:12px;">Looker Studio</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass task-card">
              <div>
                <div class="kicker mono">03 · Looker Studio</div>
                <h3 class="task-title">Tugas 3 — Looker Studio &amp; Sajian Data Google Sheet</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Pengolahan dan penyajian data terstruktur di Google Sheets yang terhubung langsung dengan Looker Studio untuk menampilkan analisis komparatif serta ringkasan statistik yang dinamis.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kicker" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.12); padding-top:12px;">Looker Studio · Google Sheets</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass task-card">
              <div>
                <div class="kicker mono">04 · Google Form &amp; Sheet</div>
                <h3 class="task-title">Tugas 4 — Google Form, Spreadsheet &amp; Looker Studio</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Penerapan alur kerja data terintegrasi mulai dari input kuesioner di Google Form, pengolahan otomatis di Google Spreadsheet, hingga pelaporan visual secara real-time di Looker Studio.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kicker" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.12); padding-top:12px;">Google Forms · Google Sheets · Looker Studio</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass task-card">
              <div>
                <div class="kicker mono">05 · Tugas Akhir</div>
                <h3 class="task-title">Tugas Akhir — Rangkuman Proyek Terpadu</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Kompilasi menyeluruh dari seluruh tahapan tugas—mulai dari pengumpulan data Google Form, sajian Google Sheets, hingga dashboard Looker Studio sebagai portofolio akhir semester.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kicker" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,29,51,0.12); padding-top:12px;">Google Workspace · Looker Studio · Dokumentasi</div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="hobi" class="reveal">
      <div class="glass card-pad">
        <p class="kicker">03. Minat &amp; Aktivitas</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:2rem; color:#5E0B1E; margin-top:6px;">Menari &amp; Badminton</h2>
        <div class="hobbies-grid">
          
            <div class="glass hobby-card">
              <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Ekspresi gerak tari kontemporer dalam pencahayaan panggung gelap" />
              <div class="hobby-body">
                <p class="kicker">Ekspresi Gerak &amp; Ritme Budaya</p>
                <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem; color:#5E0B1E; margin-top:4px;">Menari</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Menari menjadi ruang bagi saya untuk melatih kepekaan ritme, keluwesan, dan ekspresi diri. Aktivitas ini menjaga keseimbangan antara rutinitas perkuliahan dan kreativitas personal.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass hobby-card">
              <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Kok dan raket badminton di atas lapangan gelap dengan pencahayaan dramatis" />
              <div class="hobby-body">
                <p class="kicker">Ketangkasan, Fokus &amp; Sportivitas</p>
                <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem; color:#5E0B1E; margin-top:4px;">Badminton</h3>
                <p class="task-desc">Di lapangan bulu tangkis, saya mengasah refleks cepat, daya tahan fisik, serta kerja sama tim. Olahraga ini membantu menjaga stamina dan fokus dalam aktivitas akademik sehari-hari.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="kontak" class="glass card-pad reveal">
      <p class="kicker">04. Terhubung</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:2rem; color:#5E0B1E; margin-top:6px;">Kontak</h2>
      <p class="task-desc" style="margin-top:10px;">
        Email: <strong class="mono">illacasya@gmail.com</strong> · Alamat: <strong>Jalan Listrik II</strong>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 <strong>Amanda Tasya Salsabilla</strong> · Universitas Lambung Mangkurat
  </footer>

  <script>
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible');
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.12 });
    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
